{
  "contentId": "1229878836",
  "title": "南京大屠杀公祭日内容发布审核标准",
  "body": "<table data-bordercolor=\"#cccccc\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-e131fe01-0ce5-4537-b672-329ca25bc8d1\"><tbody><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-35BhWvom\"><th data-colwidth=\"99\" width=\"99\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-61d3cbea-3fe3-47b7-a72b-e9185dbee5e5\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-147b676e-3dbd-40d8-ad33-17df931345ce\">风险点</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"99\" width=\"99\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-1b8def97-48a3-4852-b643-624e09e154cf\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-7eb52238-b12b-4e4d-98a4-d031318b8407\">业态</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"235\" width=\"235\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-a853ecd4-6ef6-4acf-bf1c-d7e61037a813\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-cfcfb0e0-5a02-4124-92af-22785ff696d5\">标准</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"540\" width=\"540\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-0b4bcf31-1559-4955-82c8-629cc796d241\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-9f6fb088-0222-4046-99db-b2a3fe3b6cc3\">标准细则</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"430\" width=\"430\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-57db02de-e223-4a46-ac9a-1ad13316d6c9\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-9ae935db-8ca9-4a45-ba07-164fb856a817\">文字案例</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"550\" width=\"550\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-e0a52ea4-5aa1-4e2f-9f24-98b025acc775\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0db925aa-2cb1-469c-9d49-b749929bf85e\">图片案例</p></th></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-1ExDNdXq\"><td rowspan=\"7\" data-colwidth=\"99\" width=\"99\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-52149a5b-77f0-4153-bd46-dd4b76e09ff4\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6eec425e-84a6-40bf-b4e5-5686392ac35c\">精日</p></td><td rowspan=\"6\" data-colwidth=\"99\" width=\"99\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-fa7633d8-2d74-4134-904c-5a0797b6b99f\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ada3cd9d-a029-4553-ab6e-8705ea8405e1\">内容</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"235\" width=\"235\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-5e21e845-8517-4679-ae13-d5475d3b64e0\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-95c30bce-999e-49df-901f-499bcee03ea1\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">诋毁爱国情感</span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"540\" width=\"540\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-7b0c954f-e131-4051-957b-10be668714c5\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-c88909ee-6f45-4ead-885b-aaaa6b0bbe0b\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-knUPClFe\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6a40445a-9f1e-4b75-a3ed-a75b12606355\">涉及爱国有罪论、把爱国与民粹主义（理解为极端民族主义）联系的内容需打击</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-ZJ4sUU6H\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-60dbdccb-ef1a-4eef-81b8-1fa7f240cb69\">涉及刻意回避历史事实，诋毁国人仇日、恨日的相关内容 </p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0a6d7c05-fdfa-403d-b9df-d46f99571d4d\"></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"430\" width=\"430\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-ddea6fba-0255-46bc-b9e1-755dabac50f5\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-fe96041c-907e-4bb2-b0d8-4813be8441bf\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-LVpKZgtr\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-c589a9a4-5045-4e7c-8eef-2f38b8cfaea8\">你爱过国，国家爱你吗</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-9vu0Yw5T\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6bbc202d-ac9b-4438-bad0-45856cd1dcb0\">屁民没有资格爱国</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-K03xBxCi\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-abdcd705-ab4b-4823-b03f-7e0895aad482\">中国人仇视日本人其实是打心里的不自信，羡慕日本是发达国家</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6b34ff58-26ab-460b-8853-5978e3fd72c4\"></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"550\" width=\"550\" class=\"overflow\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-77ab47ae-fa2c-4187-9bc2-8548bd6684d0\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2c80a965-6c05-4512-83cb-1d9567a9d1d9\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 440px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414969883?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414910871?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414969882?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"440\" data-height=\"185\"></span>​</p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-hplVsiZY\"><td data-colwidth=\"235\" width=\"235\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-c527c03f-2850-455a-affe-9893d5a0d2ff\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-63ad8ecc-b1ad-4699-b8c8-8c76852ba29d\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">侮辱抗日英烈</span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"540\" width=\"540\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-33adf46b-29bf-4e32-8e1f-c821eb4e9bb7\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-e882b2ea-332a-48c4-959f-700babed66f7\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-6LnBZXOM\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-3fad7993-4170-432b-ac32-5529249f56d1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68)\">破坏、污损人民英雄纪念碑及其名称、碑题、碑文、浮雕、图形、标志，以及其它英雄烈士纪念设施的，需打击</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-9F9gkXC2\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-328514cc-b57a-46cd-81b7-3b87b4e026c0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68)\">在英雄烈士纪念设施场所展示低俗不雅行为的，需打击</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-qSET7AvK\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-91914151-5dfb-4368-91d2-8269b6a9eb67\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68)\">攻击、辱骂、调戏、恶搞、歪曲、丑化、亵渎、否定英雄烈士事迹和精神，以及相关历史虚无内容的，需打击</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-Mp8hdfIb\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-f8f6752d-4d12-473c-964c-b75cfcd3bf29\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68)\">侮辱、诽谤或者其他方式侵害英雄烈士的姓名、肖像、名誉、荣誉的，需打击</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-bWyEoonw\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-3b1ccc75-7d79-4464-b04c-64da1bee53bd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68)\">借英雄烈士的姓名、肖像、名誉、荣誉进行商标、商业广告、营销的，需打</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-X8yLBShg\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-c1234ca7-d89b-4bb6-99ba-c40b55af7245\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68)\">正常英雄烈士题材作品、公益广告，宣传英雄烈士事迹和精神的，不打击</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"430\" width=\"430\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-70758faf-98fa-4e5c-b48a-7547b72bc043\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-908ce4f5-c806-47fd-9f0b-a20ac37edebc\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-e7XmVDhe\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0fa9626d-e89f-4c1a-bfc9-63da36c8ab58\">历史虚无主义：</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-1be68a55-6a92-4531-9d08-869d320a095a\">痛心！抗日英雄杨靖宇不是被日本人杀害的，一直骗了我们78年</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-c5cf7432-b8e4-4799-9eaa-04fc813bf94e\">首曝东北抗日的惊天真相 原来几代人都被骗了</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-93a096d1-258c-43d2-87b5-12d7d18f4129\">赵一曼遭日军酷刑侮辱身体炭化私处受损</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-e1580cd6-6a2a-4d02-837f-6c3db154e5c6\">赵一曼被日本宪兵用活蛇塞进她的阴道里</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ca23f4cb-d471-496a-b5d1-2f7ea4891d34\">女英雄赵一曼受刑生理反应到大小便失禁，日本血腥电刑</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4e1c0495-9c1a-4fac-ae02-4e222818676e\"><span style=\"color: \">狼牙山五壮士实际上是几个土八路，当年逃到狼牙山一带后，用手中的枪欺压当地村民，致当地村民不满。后来村民将这5个人的行踪告诉日军，又引导这5个人向绝路方向逃跑</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"550\" width=\"550\" class=\"overflow\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-99b1370f-0d55-4139-a97b-78760ac0bdc9\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-a2dd69c5-176f-4a4b-adcc-933cd3376d37\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 197px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414776912?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414985040?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414776911?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"197\" data-height=\"135\"></span><span style=\"color: \">​</span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 165px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414994784?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414994783?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414910921?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"165\" data-height=\"92\"></span><span style=\"color: \">​</span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 131px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414225775?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414969885?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414969884?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"131\" data-height=\"98\"></span><span style=\"color: \">​</span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 105px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414994785?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414985041?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414891461?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"105\" data-height=\"59\"></span><span style=\"color: \">​</span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 133px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414852274?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414994786?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414985042?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"133\" data-height=\"122\"></span><span style=\"color: \">​</span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 126px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414985043?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414225776?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1229878836/1414776913?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"126\" data-height=\"137\"></span><span style=\"color: \">​</span><br><span style=\"color: \"><br></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-Jo4bl1jn\"><td data-colwidth=\"235\" width=\"235\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-d6d0502c-c209-4b01-aa04-bcbc80a7a61b\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-d174ecc9-124f-4781-bea8-2463f37e4189\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">美化日本侵略</span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"540\" width=\"540\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-2e3395e0-2808-46e0-a154-43407199485d\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-a9ee8b94-16b2-4b34-9fc8-ffe65506c134\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-pp6mcsT0\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-f4360698-39d0-489b-8bd3-856bab5f57c0\"><span style=\"color: \">宣扬、美化、崇拜日本侵华战争和实施殖民统治的言论需打击</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-YnLzlicg\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-54bc94aa-27a1-4aad-a49a-daa2ff97a617\"><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 25, 25)\">掩饰、歪曲日本侵略历史事实的内容需打击</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-wbDN9UnQ\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6f01ba75-6f30-46a5-80a3-0b6de0965f0b\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">崇拜、洗白日本战犯的内容需打击</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-166ncuHF\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-5a563b43-daca-410c-b9e4-485f7ae0988c\">参拜日本靖国神社、<span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">乃木神社等供奉战犯行为的内容需打击（文字批判可以通过）</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-d8e62614-8526-4995-b1c7-821ebf1d9ef2\">战犯神社：靖国神社、<span style=\"color: rgb(18, 18, 18)\">乃木神社、东乡神社、护国神社（如京都霊山护国神社、鹿儿岛护国神社）</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-cf38bd74-3c54-438e-a4f2-f2f875b717ae\">主要战犯：<span style=\"color: \">东条英机、土肥原贤二、松井石根、木村兵太郎、</span><br><span style=\"color: \">广田弘毅、板垣征四郎、武藤章、松岗洋右、永野修身、白鸟敏夫、平沼骐一郎、小矶国昭、梅津美治郎、东乡茂德、乃木希典</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-13a141de-badb-4865-989b-86d4cc01a3b0\"><br></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-c76b6794-af0e-4686-9df4-545f7b81f8e4\"></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"430\" width=\"430\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-ead5dde1-d26e-4c26-9a85-1273467f6312\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-40e8a50f-40fb-49d6-8899-5ee3a11cd4e3\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-BKgV0xC7\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-884354dd-1f35-4650-9907-9d4d6ee7ead3\">日本人只是纪念自己国家的战争英雄，立场不同应该尊重。</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-Afb7q19L\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4e2673a4-0709-467f-b4fa-82836c53d40d\">为什么东条英机是侵略者,而成吉思汗是民族英雄。。。。。 因为日本输了</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-kQv1gkvL\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-d9f37182-28af-4aba-8249-2000e4d3814b\"><span style=\"color: \">乃木希典，其人愚拙，然其心精忠，诚然日人之爱国者也。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-DgijKkxu\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-9eca3ce5-ed82-461c-979f-2bfd2e2991ac\"><span style=\"color: \">日本神风特攻队太牛逼了</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"550\" width=\"550\" class=\"overflow\" style=\"